WEBVTT

00:00:23.053 --> 00:00:26.230
Look, I can't help it if she's
got her knickers in a twist.

00:00:26.274 --> 00:00:28.929
What Lav and I have, well,

00:00:28.972 --> 00:00:31.497
let's just say,
there's no stopping it.

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:33.063
It's chemical.

00:00:33.107 --> 00:00:37.546
Will it last? Who knows?
Point is, I'm a free agent.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:40.201
HERMIONE:
He's at perfect liberty
to kiss whoever he likes.

00:00:40.244 --> 00:00:43.030
I really couldn't care less.

00:00:43.073 --> 00:00:45.336
Was I under the impression
he and I would be attending

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:47.164
Slughorn's Christmas
party together?

00:00:47.208 --> 00:00:48.818
Yes.

00:00:48.862 --> 00:00:51.168
Now, given the circumstances,

00:00:51.212 --> 00:00:53.431
I've had to make
other arrangements.

00:00:53.475 --> 00:00:54.781
Have you?

00:00:54.824 --> 00:00:56.957
Yes. Why?

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.002
I just thought,
seeing as neither of us

00:00:59.046 --> 00:01:00.743
can go with who
we'd really like to,

00:01:00.787 --> 00:01:03.180
we should go together,
as friends.

00:01:03.224 --> 00:01:04.965
Why didn't I think of that?

00:01:05.008 --> 00:01:06.662
Who are you going with?

00:01:06.706 --> 00:01:08.621
Um, it's a surprise.

00:01:08.664 --> 00:01:10.492
Anyway, it's you we've
got to worry about.

00:01:10.536 --> 00:01:13.495
You can't just take anyone.

00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:15.671
See that girl over there?

00:01:16.846 --> 00:01:18.544
That's Romilda Vane.

00:01:18.587 --> 00:01:21.851
Apparently she's trying
to smuggle you a love potion.

00:01:21.895 --> 00:01:24.332
Really?

00:01:24.375 --> 00:01:26.160
Hey!
She's only interested in you

00:01:26.203 --> 00:01:27.944
because she thinks
you're the Chosen One.

00:01:27.988 --> 00:01:29.467
But I am the Chosen One.

00:01:29.511 --> 00:01:32.906
Okay, sorry. Um, kidding.

00:01:34.995 --> 00:01:36.300
I'll ask someone I like.

00:01:36.344 --> 00:01:39.086
Someone cool.

00:01:48.486 --> 00:01:51.489
LUNA:
I've never been to this
part of the castle.

00:01:51.533 --> 00:01:53.143
At least not while awake.

00:01:53.187 --> 00:01:54.884
I sleepwalk, you see.

00:01:54.928 --> 00:01:56.538
That's why I wear shoes to bed.

00:02:28.657 --> 00:02:31.747
Harmonia Nectere Passus.

00:02:44.151 --> 00:02:47.023
Harmonia Nectere Passus.

00:02:48.459 --> 00:02:51.245
Harmonia Nectere Passus.

00:03:03.213 --> 00:03:04.171
[FLASHBULB WHINES]

00:03:04.214 --> 00:03:05.694
[CROWD CHATTERING]

00:03:05.738 --> 00:03:08.044
Drink?

00:03:08.088 --> 00:03:09.567
Neville.

00:03:09.611 --> 00:03:11.178
I didn't get into the Slug Club.

00:03:11.221 --> 00:03:12.701
It's okay, though.

00:03:12.745 --> 00:03:14.398
He's got Belby handing
out towels in the loo.

00:03:14.442 --> 00:03:15.486
Oh, well, I'm fine, mate.

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:17.358
Thanks.
Okay.

00:03:17.401 --> 00:03:18.402
Excuse me?

00:03:18.446 --> 00:03:19.665
Tartare?

00:03:22.493 --> 00:03:24.017
[FLASHBULB WHINES]

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:30.806
Hermione. What are you doing?
And what happened to you?

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.895
No, I've just escaped.

00:03:32.939 --> 00:03:36.290
I mean, I left Cormac
under the mistletoe.

00:03:36.333 --> 00:03:39.510
Cormac?
That's who you invited?

00:03:39.554 --> 00:03:42.122
I thought it would
annoy Ron the most.

00:03:42.165 --> 00:03:44.994
SLUGHORN:
Thank you very much.
I'll catch up with you later.

00:03:45.038 --> 00:03:48.171
He's got more tentacles
than a Snarfalump plant.

00:03:48.215 --> 00:03:50.521
Dragon tartare?No, I'm fine. Thank you.

00:03:50.565 --> 00:03:53.350
Just as well. They give
one horribly bad breath.

00:03:53.394 --> 00:03:55.352
On second thought...

00:03:55.396 --> 00:03:57.703
Might keep Cormac at bay.

00:03:57.746 --> 00:03:59.400
Oh, God, here he comes.

00:04:03.186 --> 00:04:06.189
I think she just went
to powder her nose.

00:04:06.233 --> 00:04:08.409
Slippery little minx,
your friend.

00:04:08.452 --> 00:04:10.454
Likes to work her mouth too,
doesn't she?

00:04:10.498 --> 00:04:11.804
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:04:14.154 --> 00:04:16.417
What is this I'm eating,
by the way?

00:04:17.418 --> 00:04:19.246
Dragon balls.

00:04:23.076 --> 00:04:25.339
[VOMITS]

00:04:30.257 --> 00:04:33.521
You've just bought yourself
a month's detention, McLaggen.

00:04:33.564 --> 00:04:37.568
Not so quick, Potter.

00:04:39.396 --> 00:04:42.225
Sir, I really think I should
rejoin the party. My date--

00:04:42.269 --> 00:04:46.316
Can surely survive your absence
for another minute or two.

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:48.754
Besides, I only wish
to convey a message.

00:04:48.797 --> 00:04:51.626
A message?From Professor Dumbledore.

00:04:51.669 --> 00:04:53.193
He asked me to give
you his best,

00:04:53.236 --> 00:04:55.456
and he hopes you
enjoy your holiday.

00:04:55.499 --> 00:04:58.764
You see, he's traveling,

00:04:58.807 --> 00:05:02.811
and he won't return
until term resumes.

00:05:02.855 --> 00:05:04.682
Traveling where?

00:05:10.906 --> 00:05:12.255
[CLATTERING]

00:05:12.299 --> 00:05:14.605
Take your hands off me,
you filthy Squib!

00:05:14.649 --> 00:05:15.737
FILCH:
Professor Slughorn, sir.

00:05:15.781 --> 00:05:17.434
[FLASHBULB WHINES]

00:05:17.478 --> 00:05:21.917
I just discovered this boy
lurking in an upstairs corridor.

00:05:21.961 --> 00:05:24.137
He claims to have been
invited to your party.

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:25.965
Okay, okay.
I was gatecrashing.

00:05:26.008 --> 00:05:27.618
Happy?

00:05:27.662 --> 00:05:31.622
I'll escort him out.

00:05:34.277 --> 00:05:38.064
Certainly, professor.

00:05:42.242 --> 00:05:44.984
All right, everyone,
carry on, carry on.

00:05:46.899 --> 00:05:48.857
DRACO:
Maybe I did hex that Bell girl.

00:05:48.901 --> 00:05:51.947
Maybe I didn't.
What's it to you?

00:05:51.991 --> 00:05:54.210
SNAPE:
I swore to protect you.

00:05:54.254 --> 00:05:57.735
I made the Unbreakable Vow.

00:05:57.779 --> 00:06:00.042
I don't need protection.

00:06:00.086 --> 00:06:05.134
I was chosen for this.
Out of all others. Me.

00:06:05.178 --> 00:06:09.269
And I won't fail him.You're afraid, Draco.

00:06:09.312 --> 00:06:11.575
You attempt to conceal it,
but it's obvious.

00:06:11.619 --> 00:06:13.360
Let me assist you.

00:06:13.403 --> 00:06:15.144
No!

00:06:15.188 --> 00:06:18.756
I was chosen.
This is my moment.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:32.596
RON:
"Unbreakable Vow."

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.555
You're sure that's
what Snape said?

00:06:34.598 --> 00:06:36.992
Positive. Why?

00:06:37.036 --> 00:06:40.691
Well, it's just you can't
break an Unbreakable Vow.

00:06:40.735 --> 00:06:44.521
I'd worked that much out
for myself, funnily enough.

00:06:44.565 --> 00:06:46.915
You don't understand.

00:06:46.959 --> 00:06:48.090
Oh, bloody hell.

00:06:50.658 --> 00:06:52.268
[EXHALES HEAVILY]

